      "writtenOn": "2022-07-15T13:56:58Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How so? The VM blitter is tied to a particular surface - we should be able to plumb the same information through (it\u0027s going to be annoying, because it uses separate arguments, rather than a bundle like SkStageRec).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 320,
        "startChar": 7,
        "endLine": 320,
        "endChar": 90
      },
      "revId": "838ab27b0e937c5250cb707bc83f7d6d926de22c",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
    {
