      "message": "I don\u0027t see any surfaces in `SkVMBlitter`.  There\u0027s an `SkPixmap`, but that explicitly omits most of the canvas/surface-related stuff.  I\u0027m definitely a bit fuzzy on how this stuff is used, though... so please correct me.\n\nRegardless, I\u0027m happy to do the extra plumbing if you think there\u0027s a case for it, but given the scope of the additional changes required, I\u0027d rather do it in a follow-up CL, if that\u0027s OK.",
      "parentUuid": "20d45fbc_8ac9e109",
